<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH BUDGET SHOWS CZK 1.2 BLN JAN-OCT SURPLUS.</title>
<headline>CZECH BUDGET SHOWS CZK 1.2 BLN JAN-OCT SURPLUS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech 1996 state budget showed a surplus of 1.2 billion crowns for the first 10 months of the year, the Finance Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p> CZECH STATE BUDGET	Jan-Oct 96    Jan-Sept 96   Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>  revenue (czk bln)	  394.0	   347.392	 355.7</p>
<p>  expenditure		  392.8	   347.344	 343.4</p>
<p>  balance			 +1.2	    +0.048	 +12.3</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
